### Angadix API Test Suite
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Healthcheck Endpoint
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### 2. Register New User (Step 1)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Register Validation Error Test (Should return 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. Verify Email Address (Step 2)
# Replace {{token}} with the raw token printed in dev server logs or sent via email
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email/REPLACE_WITH_RAW_VERIFICATION_TOKEN

### 5. Login User (Step 3)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Token Variables (Paste token from login response below)
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 6. Get Current User Profile (/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Refresh Access Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### 8. Forgot Password Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}

### 9. Reset Password (Step 2)
# Replace {{token}} with the raw reset token from dev server logs
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password/REPLACE_WITH_RAW_RESET_TOKEN
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "password": "NewSecurePassword123!"
}

### 10. Login with New Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "NewSecurePassword123!"
}

### 11. Get User Profile (/users/profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Update User Profile (/users/profile)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Jane Doe Updated",
  "avatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330"
}

### 13. Change Password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "currentPassword": "NewSecurePassword123!",
  "newPassword": "AnotherPassword456!"
}

### 14. Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Create Category (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Gadgets, devices, and electronic accessories"
}

### 16. Get All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?isActive=true

### 17. Get Category by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/electronics

### 18. Create Brand (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Apple",
  "description": "Think Different - Premium Consumer Electronics"
}

### 19. Get All Brands
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands?isActive=true

### 20. Get Brand by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands/apple

### 21. Create Product (Admin Only)
# Replace category ID with valid ObjectId from GET /categories
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro 16-inch M3 Max",
  "description": "The ultimate pro laptop featuring the M3 Max chip with 16-core CPU and 40-core GPU.",
  "shortDescription": "16-inch M3 Max MacBook Pro with 36GB RAM and 1TB SSD",
  "category": "66b2a1234567890123456789",
  "price": 349900,
  "discountPrice": 329900,
  "currency": "INR",
  "stock": 15,
  "sku": "MBP16-M3MAX-36GB-1TB",
  "specifications": [
    { "key": "Processor", "value": "Apple M3 Max" },
    { "key": "RAM", "value": "36GB" },
    { "key": "Storage", "value": "1TB SSD" }
  ],
  "tags": ["laptop", "apple", "macbook", "pro"],
  "isFeatured": true,
  "isBestSeller": true
}

### 22. Get All Products (Paginated & Filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10&isFeatured=true&sort=newest

### 23. Get Product by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/macbook-pro-16-inch-m3-max

### 24. Quick Product Stock Update (Admin Only)
# Replace product ID with valid ObjectId
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/66b2a1234567890123456789/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "stock": 25
}

### 25. Homepage Aggregated Products Endpoint (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/homepage

